    {
      "id": "295e9863-9c5e-4204-bb64-bc0bdb6de5fb",
      "widgetId": "rich_note",
      "name": "Step 1: Guidance",
      "groupId": "e6a816de-5c3a-49d4-83fe-7af24a487dc5",
      "innerTab": "step-1",
      "storage": {
        "html": "<h1>Extract Management Guidance from Transcripts</h1><ol class=\"list-decimal pl-6\"><li><p>Click <strong>[+] \"Add widget as Context\" </strong>on the Earnings Transcript widget (top right).</p></li><li><p>Use this prompt for Copilot:</p></li></ol><p><em>\"Analyze NVDA's Q1 2025 earning transcript from the Earnings Transcript widget and extract the key management guidance. Present the result in a table with the following column: Metric, Period, Value.\"</em></p><ol class=\"list-decimal pl-6\" start=\"3\"><li><p>Tips:</p></li></ol><p>To focus <strong>Copilot</strong> on querying specific widget data, click the <strong>[+] \"Add widget as Context\"</strong> feature at the top right corner of the widget. To broaden the query to the dashboard or to focus on a different widget, click the<strong> [+] </strong>again to deselect it.</p><p>Use the search feature <strong>(Ctrl / CMD + K)</strong> to explore all built-in datasets. Then, select a widget or dashboard template to get started.</p><p></p>",
        "color": "#004466"
      },
      "params": [],
