    {
      "id": "5cffa9e1-42f9-4802-b64f-c7b121fb3b87",
      "widgetId": "rich_note",
      "name": "Step 2: Filings",
      "groupId": "e6a816de-5c3a-49d4-83fe-7af24a487dc5",
      "innerTab": "step-2",
      "storage": {
        "html": "<h1>Compare Past Guidance with Results from Filings</h1><p>You can add your data, whether internal or third-party, to enhance your analysis. You'll find an uploaded 10Q for NVDA for Q2 2025 on the right.</p><p>Use <strong>Copilot</strong> to compare the management guidance with the actual results in Q2.</p><ol class=\"list-decimal pl-6\"><li><p>Click <strong>[+] \"Add widget as Context\"</strong> on the NVIDIA 10Q Q2 2025 widget</p></li><li><p>Use this prompt for <strong>Copilot</strong>:</p></li></ol><p><em>“Extract all key metrics from NVIDIA’s Q2 Financial Report and compare them with management guidance provided back in Q1. Provide a table with the following columns: Metric, Guidance High, Mid, Low, Actual Result, and % Difference from the Mid.”</em></p><ol class=\"list-decimal pl-6\" start=\"3\"><li><p>Tip:</p></li></ol><p>To <strong>\"Add data,\"</strong> you can:</p><ul class=\"list-disc pl-4\"><li><p>Go to the <strong>\"Data Connectors\"</strong> tab</p></li><li><p>Right-click the dashboard</p></li><li><p>Click the<strong> \"+\" </strong>icon in the bottom right corner</p></li></ul><p></p>",
        "color": "#004466"
      },
      "params": [],
