        "html": "<h1>Search the web with Copilot tools</h1><p>Notably, despite a positive earnings report, NVIDIA's stock still fell. Ask Copilot to search the web and explore the reasons behind this decline.</p><ol class=\"list-decimal pl-6\"><li><p>Try asking Copilot:</p></li></ol><p><em>\"Nvidia recently had a positive earnings report. Why did the stock price decline?\"</em></p><ol class=\"list-decimal pl-6\" start=\"2\"><li><p>Tip:</p></li></ol><p>To access <strong>Copilot</strong> tools provided by your team or through third-party solutions, use the search and feature toggles in Copilot settings.</p>",
